Each main rune is surrounded by angular micro-runes. Each angle point generates an equation from LIVE SYSTEM STATE:

**Variables drawn from:**
| Symbol | Source |
|--------|--------|
| τ | CPU temperature (Kelvin) |
| μ | Memory pressure (0-1) |
